{
  "id": "2CH.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "2CH",
  "reference": "2 Damanyoojiga 18",
  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CH 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sibaneeda was Mikaya ghamiin gheang'da Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabaruur Yehoshafati nea ghwanyas mureeda; ama ng'ata gwasin duupcheeda geeshooda jea gageeshi aba heeda Ahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata gweanyeeksu ng'ay gwararang'eesa heeda Ahabu aba Samariya. Ng'ata gwajeeng'sheesa Ahabu niny sea fuga mideawa gisilga ea heewga manda mooneeda, ama ng'ata gamus goodeayi niny gwadiyeada gang'uchi sea Ramot-gileyadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Ahabu was sugoocheanda Israeli Yehoshafateeda was sugoocheanda Yuda, “Gajeeteayeena Ramot-gileyadi?” Hean gwayeesha niny, “Aniini geawuurjeewaneey, fugeasu gawuurji gaagu. Aseasa gajeendeayeena aba jeeda ng'ucheeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Yehoshafati sugoocheanda Israeli, “Gida madeeda aleeysiina iit gidanyah NG'UTAMIIDA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghabwada geat sugoocheanda Israeli sibanga, was fih bughalaji ang'wan, ak gwayeesha, “Gajeeweaya eeng'ucheewana Ramot-gileyadi, ghana ghang'wana ghaanung'waadi?” Hean gwayeesha saawa, “Ng'eada una; aba gideaba ASEETA gayghwayiin saawa geatinga sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yehoshafati, “Neada ea manda hiji sibaneeda nuut bea NG'UTAMIIDA jea eepearsiina ng'asheanda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha sugoocheanda Israeli Yehoshafati, “Gwanda siida nuut jea eamuusa eepearsiina ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA, Mikayaheeda was orjeeda Imla gil; aniini ghaasichi niny, aba gideaba inyeesa ea marukuneani gea miyaas, geaghus gea munyas ak ghwahit.” Hean gwayeesha Yehoshafati, “Adiidu gwarugu ng'asheanji sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa sugoocheanda Israeli siyagi haw ak gwayeesha, “Eani hiji Mikayaheeda was orjeeda Imla.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda sugoocheanda Israeli sea Yehoshafati was sugoocheanda Yuda goobiitpiit aba iheenga hoorgajeega nyaawa, nea niikwa hang'weaka nyaawa, nea goobiitpiit aba heeda silakiisa booga bea gidaghuuta Samariya; nea sibanga sean ghwaramoar aba madeeda nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Sedekiyaheeda was orjeeda Genaana ea nisissa geaw gujaka gharinga, ak gwayi, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Aba gujaksu gaygutkuta fuga Shaamu bwak ea goosha.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwanyaashtunu sibanga sean, ak gwayeesha, “Una diyeeng'siina Ramot-gileyadi ak ginyagaadi; aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gayghwayiin jeeda geatinga sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea giijasoocheanda weah gaguursa Mikaya gwayeesha niny, “Ng'ula, ng'asheega sibanga aba ghuudagi gabaloola gea miyaasiin aba badayda sugoocheanda; nung' gawuurji ng'asheagaagu geaba siyagi aba jeeda nyaawa, ak gibalooli gea miyaas.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Mikaya, “Aba gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA, gichea gwarugu ASEETA, gayghoah gichea dargu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwahidu heeda sugoocheanda, ng'ata gwayeesha sugoocheanda niny, “Ea Mikaya, gajeescheeng'siina Ramot-gileyadi eeng'ucheewana, ghana jea danung'waada?” Hean gwayeesha, “Una diyeada ak ging'uchi; aba gideaba gajeayiin jeeda geatingeagwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha sugoocheanda niny, “Miigoola darukuneeyi damanyoojiga saang'a gideaba inyeesa girukuneani gea huumwa aba gheawunga NG'UTAMIIDA?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Ghaadaayi fuga Israeli nea nidardeaysa iheenga giijeega, nea gawuurji gisilga manda jeagiischoocheanda; ak gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Suh mandeawana siida ahaaghwa, daba siisi biikta ghoah nea gaba hoyyoo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha sugoocheanda fuga Israeli heeda Yehoshafati, “Miidarukuneeyi gideaba moamu gabaloola gea miyaasiin aba badaydeanyu, geaghus gea munyas?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Mikaya, “Asi aleaydiit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA: Ghaadaayi NG'UTAMIIDA nea goopteada aba badayda hoorgeadaanyi, nea shirikarajeagaaschi sean bea humng'eeda goobiitpiit aba meatkweadaanyi bea geatinda dugwa ea geatinda ghaadaam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ‘Gaygwareengani ng'eaha Ahabuheeda was sugoocheanda fuga Israeli, gaygwadiyeesa Ramot-gileyadi ak abeeda gaygoobeedeaysa hoowa?’ Hean gwarugu siisi ng'asheanji nea gwarugu niirja ng'asheanda nuut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu guroorooda ak ghamiinaada aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwayi, ‘Gaydareengani’. Hean gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA niny, ‘Gayreenganiidaani?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, ‘Gaydang'eat dawa ak gaydoaw guroorooda ng'uyeega aba ghuusiga sibangaaschi sean.’ Ng'ata, ‘Gayreengana niny, ak gaynyagaada; una ak giidoabiiwdunu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ging'ulayi ghamneawa, NG'UTAMIIDA niyiin guroorooda ng'uyeega ghuusiga sibang'su ikaaguun; nea NG'UTAMIIDA ea nibaloola gea munyas aba badaydaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata Sedekiyaheeda was orjeeda Genaana gwaneekiisa heeda Mikaya ak ghwalas goafi ak gwayeesha, “Gwariteaydaan guroorooda NG'UTAMIIDA aba heedeanyu ak ghoani goobaloolnyi ang'iing'i?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Mikaya, “Ng'ula gaydeaksiina geaw eaweeda jea una fuysiina geaw jeeda ghooriida duukusa jih.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha sugoocheanda Israeli, “Oang'aamwana hiji Mikaya, ak ghoanung' gabiikta heeda Amoneeda was siida ahaaghwa mujiini ea heeda Yoashi was orjeeda sugoocheanda; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gooyeeshi, ‘Gwayi sugoocheanda, ajaksiina siisi ghealooniga, ak ghoang'aataawa mukaateeyda mwanang' ea beesu ng'ay, bwak ea dabiigu nea geabea hoyyoo.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Mikaya, “Inyas gaybiiknana hoyyoo, abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea miigabaloola ghuuteanyu.” Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Oaleaydiit buuneeda sean!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Ahabu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwadiyeesa Ramot-gileyadi sugoocheanda Israeli sea Yehoshafati was sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha sugoocheanda Israeli Yehoshafati, “Aniini gaydayam hang'weakeasu ak geawi ng'ucheeda, nea ang'iing'i giikweali hang'weakaagu.” Hean ghwayam hang'weakaaschi sugoocheanda Israeli; ama ng'ata gaweay ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea abeeda sugoocheanda Shaamu ea niijeakta fuga miineadaysa mutukwajeagaaschi, “Adiidu goong'ucheewi siida mwanang' ghana dea haw, geaghus sugoocheanda Israeli nea gaba geaw.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwadaah fuga miineadayiisa mutukwajeagaaschi Yehoshafati, hean gwayi, “Nih sugoocheanda Israeli gil.” Hean gwayamsa geat heeda mida niny ghwanyas gichea gang'ucheata niny; hean googuul Yehoshafati ak ghwahidu weataanyi NG'UTAMIIDA. Ng'ata ghoang'aamwa headaanyi ASEETA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu gwajeeng'u fuga miineadayiisa mutukwajeega gideaba niny mii sugoocheanda Israeli gil, ghwayam geat ghang'amwa eadita geeshtaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwajakta siyagi geacheeda nea gang'acha gheang'da ak gafut gitardaawa hang'weaka gharinga bea sugoocheanda Israeli; aba ng'ata gwayeesha siida manmani mutukwajeandaanyi, “Yamwa geaw, ak giing'aamwanani jeeda ng'ucheeda, aba gideaba neasawani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
