              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'waaniit ng'ucheeda muuchi eaweedida, hean sugoocheanda Israeli gwadiiwa geaw mutukwajeandaanyi nea gang'ula fuga Shaamu bwak ea ghoah shing'ada, ama ng'ata nea nimikta aseeta hean ghoabita.",
